CRPT011493: CMC is currently unable to operate Mesa Mill No. 2 at or near its maximum production rate on a sustained basis and therefore is unable to achieve continuous compliance with the 30-day rolling average limits for SO2, CO, and NOx. 

Current report received on January 13, 2026, indicates that the 30-day rolling averages for December 2025 are 0.29 lb/ton for NOx, 0.41 lb/ton for SO2, and 2.25 lb/ton for CO.

SO2 is above the emission limit and NOx and CO are below emission limits in PC Table 18.c.2.

Emission limits in PC 18.c.2 for Mesa Mill No.2 are: 0.30 lb/ton of steel for NOx, 0.30 lb/ton of steel for SO2, and 4.00 lb/ton of steel for CO.

Note: The commissioning issues presented in the table now have extended due dates of March 2026, and June 2026.</td></tr>
