<tr><td>CRPT011483</td><td>F003654</td><td>Ninety-First Avenue Renewable Biogas</td><td>Synthetic Minor</td><td>Production Site</td><td>CMP002313</td><td>Ninety-First Avenue Renewable Biogas LLC</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Periodic Reporting</td><td>Annual digester phase gas sulfur characterization and adjustment factor calculation.  Sample collection was due before 11/30/2025, but was delayed due to a fire at the wastewater treatment plant.  Testing of acid phase gas was not possible due to the fire.  Please see the letter submitted 1/9/2026 for additional information.  
Results were received on 1/7/2026 and must be reported within 7 days, as required by Condition 9.c. of Permit #0008232.</td><td>01/13/2026</td><td>01/21/2026</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Facility submitted the compliance report within seven days of receiving the results from the testing company per Permit Condition 9.c. Date received samples December 10, 2025. Analyzed date was December 12, 2025. Report date was January 02, 2026. Submittal of compliance report was January 13, 2026 as facility received records on January 7, 2026.

