<tr><td>CRPT011178</td><td>F002813</td><td>Calgon Carbon Corporation</td><td>Minor</td><td>Chemical Manufacture, Processing, etc</td><td>CMP000654</td><td>Calgon Carbon Corporation</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Notification</td><td>24 Hour notice of malfunction that occurred 11/08/2025 at 2149. ID fan rapidly increased speed, Thermal Oxidizer flame went out, bypass stacks opened.</td><td>11/09/2025</td><td>11/10/2025</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Source submitted 24 hour malfunction notification, advising that on 11/08/25 from 2149 to 2320 hours a malfunction occurred involving the thermal oxidizer, fan, and bypass stack. The ID fan rapidly increased speed, causing the thermal oxidizer flame to extinguish. This in turn resulted in the bypass stacks opening. The equipment was restarted and the flame was restored at 2254 hours. 

The malfunction notification has been accepted.

