There are no pending emissions inventories for F003470 (Kings Mini Mart).

I performed a site visit (SITE001055) at approximately 10:20 a.m. on November 06, 2025 to determine if operations were still occurring. The facility is fenced off with signage indicating 'No trespassing" and that it is now owned by Arizona Department of Transportation (ADOT). The gas dispending pumps are covered. 

We reached out to ADOT where they stated that the property was acquired as a part of the Indian School and 35th avenue Traffic Interchange reconstruction project. The project is still in design, but it is anticipated that this project would demolish the property to build the TI. 

No further action is required at this time.</td></tr>
