CRPT011024: CMC is currently unable to operate Mesa Mill No. 2 at or near its maximum production rate on a sustained basis and therefore is unable to achieve continuous compliance with the 30-day rolling average limits for SO2, CO, and NOx. 

Current report received on October 14, 2025, indicates that the 30-day rolling averages for September 2025 are 0.26 lb/ton for NOx, 0.26 lb/ton for SO2, and 1.92 lb/ton for CO.

NOx, SO2 and CO are below emission limits in PC Table 18.c.2.

Emission limits in PC 18.c.2 for Mesa Mill No.2 are: 0.30 lb/ton of steel for NOx, 0.30 lb/ton of steel for SO2, and 4.00 lb/ton of steel for CO.

Note: The commissioning issues presented in the table have extended due dates of November 2025, December 2025, and February 2026.</td></tr>
