<tr><td>CRPT010854</td><td>F002681</td><td>SFPP-Phoenix Terminal</td><td>Title V</td><td>Petroleum Products Bulk Storage/Handling</td><td>CMP002921</td><td>SFPP LP</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Self-Report</td><td>SVE August 2025 Sampling Report</td><td>09/08/2025</td><td>09/16/2025</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SVE sampling report for August 2025. The compliance report covers the requirements of Permit Condition 34.a/b/d. The report was submitted in a timely manner on 9/08/2025, with notes as follows:

SVE UNIT 1

- 34.d.i) Sampling completed per graduated schedule: initial, 4 biweekly, 10 monthly
-- Analysis performed by Eurofins
- 34.d.ii) Flow rate: 223scfm (limit: 300scfm)
- 34.d.iii) Process temperature: 752F (minimum limit: 626F)
- 34.d.iv) Total concentration of halogenated compounds at inlet: 0.24ppmv (limit: 2,200ppmv)
- 34.d.v) Total concentration of VOC at inlet: 190ppmv (limit: 2,200ppmv)
- 34.d.vi) VOC destruction efficiency: 100% (minimum limit: 98%)

SVE UNIT 2

- 34.d.i) Sampling completed per graduated schedule: initial, 4 biweekly, 10 monthly
-- Analysis performed by Eurofins
- 34.d.ii) Flow rate: 200scfm (limit: 300scfm)
- 34.d.iii) Process temperature: 752F (minimum limit: 626F)
- 34.d.iv) Total concentration of halogenated compounds at inlet: 0.12ppmv (limit: 2,200ppmv)
- 34.d.v) Total concentration of VOC at inlet: 190ppmv (limit: 2,200ppmv)
- 34.d.vi) VOC destruction efficiency: 99% (minimum limit: 98%)

SVE UNIT 3

- 34.d.i) Sampling completed per graduated schedule: initial, 6 biweekly, 5 monthly
-- Analysis performed by Eurofins
- 34.d.ii) Flow rate: 148scfm (limit: 300scfm)
- 34.d.iii) Process temperature: 752F (minimum limit: 626F)
- 34.d.iv) Total concentration of halogenated compounds at inlet: 0.07ppmv (limit: 2,200ppmv)
- 34.d.v) Total concentration of VOC at inlet: 3.5ppmv (limit: 2,200ppmv)
- 34.d.vi) VOC destruction efficiency: 85% (minimum limit: 98%)
-- The 98% destruction efficiency is contingent on the SVE unit potentially releasing to atmosphere without bypass more than 3lbs of VOC per day. The emission rate on 8/11/2025 was 0.03lbs, therefore the 85% destruction efficiency was within compliance standards.

No issues of non-compliance determined during review of the report. See INSP212951 for further details.</td></tr>
