<tr><td>CRPT010560</td><td>F002787</td><td>Robertson Fuel Systems</td><td>Synthetic Minor</td><td>Aerospace Component Manufacturing</td><td>CMP002765</td><td>Robertson Fuel Systems LLC</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Periodic Reporting</td><td>Six Month Toluene Report January 2025 to June 2025</td><td>07/22/2025</td><td>07/30/2025</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>The facility provided the monthly and 12-month rolling total emissions and usage of toluene including the toluene content of each material for the period of January 1st through June 30th per permit condition 3. 

Permit condition 3:
The Permittee shall submit a toluene emission report to the Department every six months. The reports shall cover the periods from January 1st through June 30th and July 1st through December 31st and be submitted no later than 45 days after the end of each period using the AQD Online Portal. The Permittee shall prepare a monthly toluene emission record to be kept on-site for inspection upon request. The 12-month rolling total toluene emissions shall be calculated within 15 days following the end of each calendar month by summing the toluene emissions over the most recent twelve calendar months.
The toluene emission report shall include all of the following:
a. Monthly and 12-month rolling total emissions of toluene during the preceding 12 calendar months.
b. Monthly and 12-month rolling usage of toluene containing materials for the preceding 12 calendar months.
c. Toluene content of each material.
d. Reports shall be submitted to the department using the AQD Online Portal.

The 12-month rolling total emission and usage of toluene for June 2025 is 6,748 lbs and 983.3 gallons.</td></tr>
