<tr><td>CRPT010429</td><td>F001332</td><td>Caljet</td><td>Synthetic Minor</td><td>Petroleum Products Bulk Storage/Handling</td><td>CMP015461</td><td>Caljet of America LLC</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Test Report</td><td>On behalf of CalJet America LLC (Caljet), ENCORE Consulting LLC is submitting the attached test report for a Performance Specification (PS) 8 test performed on the facility's Continuous Emission Monitoring System (CEMS) unit. The compliance test was performed by Erthwrks Inc. on May 27, 2025.

