<tr><td>CRPT010331</td><td>F002681</td><td>SFPP-Phoenix Terminal</td><td>Title V</td><td>Petroleum Products Bulk Storage/Handling</td><td>CMP002921</td><td>SFPP LP</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Self-Report</td><td>SVE May 2025 Monthly Sampling Report</td><td>06/02/2025</td><td>06/03/2025</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>SVE sampling report for May 2025. The compliance report covers the requirements of Permit Condition 34.a/b/d. The report was submitted in a timely manner on 6/02/2025, with notes as follows:

SVE UNIT 1

- 34.d.i) Sampling completed per graduated schedule: initial, 4 biweekly, 7 monthly
-- Analysis performed by Eurofins
- 34.d.ii) Flow rate: 160scfm (limit: 300scfm)
- 34.d.iii) Process temperature: 752F (minimum limit: 626F)
- 34.d.iv) Total concentration of halogenated compounds at inlet: 0.25ppmv (limit: 2,200ppmv)
- 34.d.v) Total concentration of VOC at inlet: 210ppmv (limit: 2,200ppmv)
