<tr><td>CRPT010201</td><td>F000658</td><td>Holsum Bakery</td><td>Minor</td><td>Bakery</td><td>CMP004372</td><td>Holsum Bakery of Tolleson LLC</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Self-Report</td><td>Holsum Bakery F000658 Oxidizer Downtime for the Bread Production Line on 5-3-25. The Bread Oven ran from 3:15am – 7am without the oxidizer running (3 Hours and 45 Mins, roughly).  The Bread Oxidizer was not permforming from 2:00am – 7:00am (roughly).</td><td>05/28/2025</td><td>05/30/2025</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>The facility reported that on May 3, 2025, the bread oven operated from 3:15 a.m. to 7:00 a.m., while the bread oxidizer remained offline from 2:00 a.m. to 7:00 a.m. This lapse was attributed to an operator’s failure to activate the oxidizer as required. To prevent a recurrence, the facility indicated that activating the oxidizer will be added to the pre-operation checklist for all operators. The facility confirmed that no exceedance of VOC emissions occurred as a result of this incident.</td></tr>
