calibration certificate for the monitor was provided.

Monitoring was conducted at twelve locations along the property line of the site. 

The monitoring period at each location was ten minutes and three H2S readings were made at each location at the intervals as specified in the permit.

The results of the test show that the H2S gas monitoring at the perimeter of the Northwest Regional Landfill were at 0 ppbv, which is below the permit threshold of 30 ppbv.

No non compliance issues were noted. 

