CRPT009901: CMC is currently unable to operate Mesa Mill No. 2 at or near its maximum production rate on a sustained basis, and therefore is unable to achieve continuous compliance with the 30-day rolling average limits for SO2, CO, and NOx. 

Current report received on March 13, 2025, indicates that the 30-day rolling averages for February 2025 are 0.32 lb/ton for NOx, 0.30 lb/ton for SO2, and 3.75 lb/ton for CO. NOx is above the emission limit, SO2 is at the emission limit, and CO is below the emission limit in PC Table 18.c.2.

Emission limits in PC 18.c.2 for Mesa Mill No.2 are: 0.30 lb/ton of steel for NOx, 0.30 lb/ton of steel for SO2, and 4.00 lb/ton of steel for CO.

Note: The commissioning issues presented in the table have all been changed to August 2025</td></tr>
