On February 14, 2025; I telephoned Mr. Roland and explained to him the notifications are understandably impractical and to henceforth keep log of the moves as attached, but only submit them upon request from the department.

Mr. Roland acknowledged and stated he has already submitted the second half of 2024 this morning.

I noted no violations with the submittal.</td></tr>
