<tr><td>CRPT009557</td><td>F002681</td><td>SFPP-Phoenix Terminal</td><td>Title V</td><td>Petroleum Products Bulk Storage/Handling</td><td>CMP002921</td><td>SFPP LP</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Title V Compliance Certification</td><td>2H 2024 Title V Semiannual & GDGACT Reports</td><td>01/30/2025</td><td>04/21/2025</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Compliance report is the Semiannual Compliance Certification and Monitoring Report for the period of 6/01/2024 to 12/31/2024. Compliance report was submitted in a timely manner on 1/30/2025.

Per the Compliance Certification Report, no deviations were noted during the reporting period.

The semi-annual monitoring report was found to be in compliance with Permit Condition 36.f. I reviewed the monitoring report, with notes as follows:

- i: Monthly inspections conducted in compliance with no deviations noted.
- ii: John Zink Oxidizer operated in bypass mode due to the saturator not being installed. No deviations were noted during the reporting period.
- iii: CAU-1 is currently out of operation. Emissions were routed through the John Zink Oxidizer for the reporting period.
- iv: SVE readings are submitted as compliance reports through IMPACT. All SVE recording operations managed by Arcadis.
- v: No issues observed with the "card access" system.
- vi: No visible emissions observed during the reporting period.
- vii: No odor complaints observed during the reporting period.
- viii: VOC list reviewed and in compliance.
- ix: No issues observed during walk-around inspections.
- x: No issues observed with architectural coatings.
- xi: No external blasting occurred during the reporting period. 
- xii: No deviations in dust-control requirements.
- xiii: 12-month rolling VOC emissions totaled 84.79tons.
- xiv: No deviations from Permit Conditions noted.
- xv: A master list of all control equipment on-site was observed on-site during last inspection however is too large to submit via IMPACT.
- xvi: The Subpart BBBBBB Report met all requirements of 40 CFR Subpart 63. The report notes 0hours of excess emissions during the reporting period. 
- xvii: No excess emissions reports were submitted during this reporting period.


Overall the compliance report was found to be in compliance with no issues observed.</td></tr>
