63.c.iv: The VOC efficiency for the SVEU was recorded.

63.f: The performance test was conducted on October 24, 2024, and submitted to MCAQD for review on December 19, 2024; therefore, the results of the test were submitted within 45-days of the test being performed as specified in the facility's permit.</td></tr>
