<tr><td>CRPT009395</td><td>F001209</td><td>SR 85 Landfill</td><td>Title V</td><td>Landfills</td><td>CMP000821</td><td>City of Phoenix</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Title V Compliance Certification</td><td>2024 Annual Compliance Certification Report for SR85LF</td><td>12/19/2024</td><td>02/07/2025</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Reviewal of SR85 Landfill Annual Compliance Certification for the time period of October 03, 2023 through October 02, 2024. Compliance status for facility permit conditions were correctly itemized on the certification report. Two intermittent compliances were selected; Permit Condition 19.C. and Permit Condition 21.C. Notice of Non-Compliance was issued for failure to submit this report by the required deadline. This non-compliance has been incorporated into the Routine Inspection report for this facility (see INSP201428). 

