•	Updated Low Range CO criteria from +/-5% difference to +/-2%, and Low Range NOx criteria from +/-5% difference to +/-2% to comply with EPA’s Clean Air Market Division’s latest CGA Alternative Performance Specifications for Units 7 and 8. 

If you have any questions or need additional information, please feel free to contact Sheena Alvarado at (602) 329-1395 or Jenn Paskash at (602) 236 – 4746.</td><td>09/12/2024</td><td>10/03/2024</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Revised Operations and Maintenance (O&M) and Quality Assurance (QA) Plan for the Continuous Emission Monitoring Systems (CEMS) operated at the Agua Fria Generating Station. Proposed changes include the following:

