On October 27, 2023, SRP submitted a permit revision application to MCAQD. As part of this revision, SRP had stated that the existing three-sided building where abrasive blasting is conducted would be enclosed and a baghouse to control particulate emissions from the abrasive blasting activities would be installed. 

