03/04/24 Sheet metal pile explosion
03/12/24 Vehicle explosion
04/15/24 Sheet metal pile explosion
05/03/24 Vehicle explosion
05/07/24 Vehicle explosion
06/04/24 Material fire
06/05/24 Vehicle explosion
06/06/24 Material fire
06/14/24 Material fire

Permit expiration: 04/30/23, permit renewal submitted 10/19/22

