		Table 1 4,800/12-mo limit with a 15,800 pound emission limit for
		which this particular subject compliance report shows the June 2024
		limit has fell to 4827.9 Kg./12 mo. which is approximately 10,643.7
		pounds. demonstrating the facility has returned to a 12-month
		rolling emission which falls within the "new" permit conditions.

On August 22, 2024; I telephoned Tyler Johnson and reviewed my inspection findings for which no compliance determination was being made.</td></tr>
