One deviation was reported under Section 18.B Table 3. A previous Notice of Non-Compliance was written for this. Facility stated "Yes – 24 Hour notification submitted on March 19, 2024 and 72 notification submitted on March 22, 2024. GT6 exceeded the NOx Startup limit of 31.4 lbs/hour on January 26, 2024.  Discovered on March 19, 2024." See INSP196550 for full details of this non-compliance.

GT7 reported downtime of 10.17% of operating time. As this is over 5%, they must also include the invalid data report. This report was included and confirmed the time it was down for was linearity checks and other known causes.

No other issues noted.</td></tr>
