Ms. Aloma stated this is not the initial filling of Tank 103, but the refilling of the tank following the [PC 23.a.iii-iv] five-year empty tank inspection (see compliance report ID: [CRPT007908] for respective notice) following which defects and repairs were made to the tank.  However, the notification requirements in PC 23.b.ii.(1) did not have an option for this particular refilling operation.

I informed Ms. Aloma, it is not a compliance issue to submit this contingent notice.  I did not locate a permit condition in permit P0007858 requiring this particular notification.

No violations noted.</td></tr>
