<tr><td>CRPT007827</td><td>F000763</td><td>Arizona State University Tempe Campus</td><td>Synthetic Minor</td><td>Institutions - Public/Government</td><td>CMP000336</td><td>Arizona State University</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Periodic Reporting</td><td>Dear Ms. Valenzuela,

Arizona State University (ASU) is submitting the attached semi-annual nitrogen oxide (NOx) and carbon monoxide (CO) emissions report for the Tempe Campus. As required by Permit
Condition 6, the report contains monthly and 12-month rolling total emission rates for the Tempe Campus from July 1, 2023, through December 31, 2023.

Thank you for your consideration. Please contact either Michael Ochs, Director, at (480)965-3580 and Michael.Ochs@asu.edu or Mary Cuevas-Delgado, Safety Partner, at (480)228-5251
and mdcuevas@asu.edu if you have any questions.</td><td>03/21/2024</td><td>04/04/2024</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Facility submitted semi-annual nitrogen oxide (NOx) and carbon monoxide (CO) emissions report as required by Permit Condition 6 of P0011372. Facility submitted this to the Air Quality Portal on March 21, 2024. The due date for this was March 1, 2024. See INSP194956 for full details of non-compliance.</td></tr>
