In rescinding of Excess Emissions Notifications, SRP presented that the clock hour in which a unit initiates a startup should be the start of the three-hour averaging consecutive clock hours. See CRPT007976 for the calculation tables of Startup Greater than or equal to 3-hours for February 1 event, and Startup Less than 3-hours for March 2, 2024.

Based on the calculation tables, source appeared to be in compliance.</td></tr>
