<tr><td>CRPT007250</td><td>F000013</td><td>Salt River Project - Santan Generating Station</td><td>Title V</td><td>Power Plant</td><td>CMP015964</td><td>Salt River Project</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Title V Compliance Certification</td><td>Semiannual Compliance Certification and Title V Monitoring Report. Reporting Period: April 1, 2023 through September 30, 2023. Due October 30.</td><td>10/30/2023</td><td>12/08/2023</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Semiannual Compliance Certification and Monitoring Report for April 1 through September 30, 2023.

Report received by October 30 due date.

Source reported two deviations from the permit:

Permit Condition 14.b. was documented intermittent compliance for failure to notify MCAQD at least seven days before the replacement of a Unit S-2 combustion system. The replacement occurred in May 2023, and Santan did not notify MCAQD until August 2023, after finding this error.

Permit Condition 18.a.ii. was documented as intermittent compliance for exceeding 1-hour average NOx emissions in April 2023. Santan properly reported the excess emissions event. MCAQD issued a Notice of Non-Compliance for this event as part of the non-routine inspection INSP179890.

No other deviations were reported in this semiannual period. MCAQD did not issue any additional noncompliance during this period.

All required elements of Permit Condition 21.a. are included in this report.

No noncompliant usage, operations, or visible emissions reported.</td></tr>
