<tr><td>CRPT006949</td><td>F000017</td><td>Salt River Project - Portable Blast Truck</td><td>Below Threshold</td><td>Abrasive Blasting, Portable</td><td>CMP015964</td><td>Salt River Project</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Permit Close Request</td><td>Salt River Project Agricultural Improvement and Power District (SRP) owns and operates a portable unit (Portable #1, henceforth “PN1”) that houses abrasive blasting equipment that supports various SRP sites throughout Maricopa County, including at permitted and non-permitted facilities. PN1 operates per Maricopa County Air Quality Department (“MCAQD”) non-Title V permit number P0007359.

Emissions generated by PN1 are consistently below the permitting thresholds as defined by MCAQD Rule 100 Section 200.94; therefore, SRP requests that P0007359 be rescinded. PN1 will be utilized at those permitted facilities for which permit conditions for abrasive blasting exist. SRP will continue to track and maintain records of abrasive blasting media usage, emissions, and locations for PN1 for both permitted and non-permitted facilities and will make those records available to MCAQD upon request.

If you have any questions regarding this submittal, please contact Nicole Rivinius at (602) 236-4733.</td><td>08/28/2023</td><td>08/30/2023</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr>
