RE: Arizona State University - Tempe Campus Facility ID No. F000763 Semi-annual NOx and CO Emissions Report Reporting Period – January 1, 2023, through June 30, 2023


Dear Ms. Valenzuela,
Arizona State University (ASU) is submitting the attached semi-annual nitrogen oxide (NOX) and carbon monoxide (CO) emissions report for the Tempe Campus. As required by Permit Condition 6, the report contains monthly and 12-month rolling total emission rates for the Tempe Campus from January 1, 2023, through June 30, 2023.

Thank you for your consideration. Please contact either Suzanne Kennedy, Director, at 480-965-1893 or Mary Cuevas-Delgado at (480) 228-5251 if you have any questions.

Sincerely,
Morgan R. Olsen
Executive Vice President, Treasurer and CFO</td><td>08/14/2023</td><td>08/24/2023</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>The facility has submitted this report pursuant to Permit Condition 6. 

