<tr><td>CRPT006376</td><td>F000220</td><td>Rogers Corporation - Roosevelt Ave Facility</td><td>Synthetic Minor</td><td>Semiconductors and Electronics</td><td>CMP002773</td><td>Rogers Corporation</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Periodic Reporting</td><td>Subpart VVV compliance report for the period 1/1/2023 through 3/31/2023.</td><td>04/17/2023</td><td>05/02/2023</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Compliance report submitted in accordance with permit conditions 19.b and 19.c, which reflect the Subpart VVV quarterly report requirements for the facility. The report was submitted in a timely manner on 17-Apr-23 for the reporting period between 01-Jan-22 to 31-Mar-22.

