- 19.b.i: the average combustion temperature of the device was more than 28 °C (50.4 °F) below the average combustion temperature of the device.
- 19.b.ii: the average total enclosure monitor readings did not meet the minimum pressure differential across draft openings of 0.007" water.
- 19.c.i: actual mixing or coating operations when a required monitoring device was malfunctioning or not operating
- 19.c.ii: actual mixing or coating operations when the control device was malfunctioning or not operating

The quarterly report was found to be in compliance with the reporting requirements for the facility.</td></tr>
