<tr><td>CRPT006275</td><td>F040964</td><td>Blucor Batch Plant</td><td>Minor</td><td>Concrete Plant, Portable</td><td>CMP016703</td><td>Blucor Contracting Inc</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>O&M Plan</td><td>O&M Plan for batch plant location on 7851 E Prairie Ave Mesa, Az 85212</td><td>03/27/2023</td><td>03/29/2023</td><td>No-Revision Requested</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>The Maricopa County Air Quality Department is in receipt of the Operations & Maintenance Plan for Blucor’s portable concrete batch plant. Unfortunately the Plan cannot be approved at this time for the following reasons:

1.	The procedures include more items than what is listed in the O&M Plan
a.	Plan only includes daily check for visible emissions
b.	Plan should also include check dust containers and empty if needed (daily)
c.	Plan should also include remove any moisture collected in compressed air manifold drain tap (weekly)
d.	Plan should also include inspect dust collector filters (monthly)
e.	Plan should also include inspect silo vent (monthly)
f.	Plan should also include semi annual and annual preventative maintenance
2.	Submitted Plan does not include operations log sheets – must include a copy of all operations log sheets utilized to document operating parameters of the control device
3.	Submitted Plan does not include maintenance log sheets – must include a copy of all maintenance checklists utilized to document completion of maintenance procedures performed on the control device

Please upload a complete Operations & Maintenance Plan as a compliance report in the AQD Online Portal.</td></tr>
