<tr><td>CRPT005918</td><td>F000701</td><td>Intel Corp - Ocotillo Campus</td><td>Title V</td><td>Semiconductors and Electronics</td><td>CMP001723</td><td>Intel Corporation</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Title V Compliance Certification</td><td>Intel Corporation is submitting this Annual Compliance Certification Report for the Ocotillo facility, located at 4500 South Dobson Road in Chandler, Arizona 85248 per Title V Permit P0009315, Facility ID F000701. This annual compliance certification report is for the reporting period from January 1st, 2022 to December 31st, 2022.</td><td>01/27/2023</td><td>02/06/2023</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>2022 Annual Compliance Certification Report received within required timeframe.

Three deviations from P0009315 permit conditions (PC) recorded. Each deviation was reported as intermittent compliance.

A deviation from PC 30.a. occurred when an on-site contractor failed to modify their Dust Control Plan prior to operating outside of permitted boundaries. The Dust Control Plan, which was operated independently from the Intel Corp Title V permit, was modified to include this additional disturbed area. No Notice of Non-Compliance issued to the contractor or to Intel Corp.

A deviation from PC 19.a.i. occurred when Fab 42 Boiler #1 failed a 5-year performance test, indicating an exceedance of BACT NOx emissions. Equipment was immediately re-tuned, and the deviation was corrected. An OTC was issued by MCAQD in January 2023 as a result of this deviation.

A deviation from PC 45 was recorded as a result of intermittent compliance from the deviations above.

No additional deviations reported. No issues noted.</td></tr>
