NOTICE OF NON-COMPLIANCE

- Failure to submit in a timely manner

A Notice of Non-Compliance has been issued due to the submission date of the report being outside of the 60 day submission period noted in Permit Condition 13. Specifically, the report covered the reporting period from 01-Jan-22 to 30-Jun-22, and therefore had a submission deadline of 01-Sep-22. The report was submitted on 16-Jan-23, outside of the reporting deadline. See INSP176569 for further details.</td></tr>
