<tr><td>CRPT005293</td><td>F001582</td><td>Vulcan Materials Co-Western Division</td><td>Minor</td><td>Nonmetallic Mineral Processing</td><td>CMP003522</td><td>Vulcan Materials Company</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Dust Control Plan</td><td>Updated DCP</td><td>09/22/2022</td><td>09/23/2022</td><td>No-Revision Requested</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>The Plan cannot be approved at this time.  Please make the following revisions and submit the new Plan as a compliance report in the AQD Online Portal:

1.	Section 2(v)(4) Soil Moisture Testing Attachments
a.	Must attach a process diagram identifying progression of material containing product &lt; 0.25” diameter through the process
b.	Provide an explanation or justification for each sampling point that a sample cannot be taken from

2.	Section 2(w)(1) Reduction In Sampling Points
a.	Must select yes or no
b.	If selecting yes, must submit a written request for approval

3.	Section 2(w)(2) Alternative Minimum Moisture Content
a.	Must select yes or no
b.	If selecting yes, must complete section and include any necessary documents

4.	Section 2(w)(3) Alternative Moisture Testing Equipment or Method
a.	Must select yes or no
b.	If selecting yes, must indicate requirements have been met and attach required documents

5.	Section 2(y) Map
a.	A Plan will not be approved unless a map is included with all of the required elements
b.	To include property boundaries, nearest public cross roads with street names, identify required areas, identify paved areas, identify exits with type of trackout control devices and dimensions, north arrow, and disturbed areas</td></tr>
