<tr><td>CRPT005299</td><td>F000789</td><td>Microchip Technology - Tempe</td><td>Minor</td><td>Semiconductors and Electronics</td><td>CMP002193</td><td>Microchip Technology Inc</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>O&M Plan</td><td>The compliance report is in fulfilment of MCAQD request to revise the RCTO 20-2 O&M Plan to include daily check of Process Fan #1 differential pressure due no later than close of business on Friday, September 9, 2022. Daily checks for Process Fan #1 and #2 were added to Table 2.1 in the uploaded document. Additionally, Section III was revised to included the following three new maintenance procedures: (1) lubricate rotor hub bearings; (2) inspect all magnehelic tubing and replace as necessary; and (3) clean out the rotor enclosure.</td><td>09/06/2022</td><td>09/07/2022</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>The compliance report is in fulfilment of MCAQD request to revise the RCTO 20-2 O&M Plan to include daily check of Process Fan #1 differential pressure due no later than close of business on Friday, September 9, 2022. Daily checks for Process Fan #1 and #2 were added to Table 2.1 in the uploaded document. Additionally, Section III was revised to included the following three new maintenance procedures: (1) lubricate rotor hub bearings; (2) inspect all magnehelic tubing and replace as necessary; and (3) clean out the rotor enclosure.</td></tr>
