Dear Ms. Valenzuela,

Arizona State University (ASU) is submitting the attached semi-annual nitrogen oxide (NOx) and carbon monoxide (CO) emissions report for the Tempe Campus. As required by Permit Condition 6, the report contains monthly and 12-month rolling total emission rates for the Tempe Campus from January 1, 2022, through June 30, 2022.

