AQ Compliance –

Please let this correspondence serve as proper notification for onsite compliance demonstration regarding EPA Method 9 testing requirement.

The compliance demonstration is scheduled for a 7:30 a.m. start time on Tuesday August 9th  2022 at the facility located @ 2144 W. McDowell, Phoenix Arizona. 

If you have any questions regarding this site visit please do not hesitate to contact me or Mr. Geoff Heitzenrater regarding the demonstration.

All visitors are required to check in at the Front Office located in South-West corner of the property.

FACILITY NUMBER: F002376 LEGACY PERMIT #: 070114 REVISION DATE: 12/02/2021 EXPIRATION DATE: 04/30/2023



AIM Recycling Phoenix LLC
2144 W. McDowell – Phx AZ
