- iv/v) No deviations from organic HAP emissions limitations
- vii) 12-month emissions totals were as follows:
-- PM10: 0.23tons (limit: 3tons)
-- VOCs: 8.83tons (limit: 59tons)
-- Singe HAP (Styrene): 7.48tons (limit: 50tons)
