<tr><td>CRPT003966</td><td>F002411</td><td>CMC Steel Fabricators</td><td>Title V</td><td>Metal Fabrication</td><td>CMP000856</td><td>CMC Steel Fabricators Inc</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Periodic Reporting</td><td>April 2021 - September 2021 CMC Semi-Annual Compliance Certification. Due October 31, 2021</td><td>10/29/2021</td><td>01/19/2022</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Review of Semi-Annual Compliance Certification began on 09-Dec-21 and completed on 19-Jan-22. 

Please note that the facility had run the CEMS VOC Excess Emissions Report for April-September 2021 and had not updated the CEMS unit with the new CO/VOC correlation factor from the most recent performance test. This caused an error to be thrown when the facility ran the 30-Day average VOC exceedance report (see attachment 240460), stating that an exceedance had occurred for the 30-Day average in June 2021.

 The facility was notified and corrected the error by updating the CEMS unit with the correct CO/VOC correlation factor. An additional VOC excess emissions report and data calculations were provided via e-mail and it was observed that the facility had not exceeded the VOC 30-Day Average in June 2021. 

**For communication e-mails, data provided, and additional excess emissions report please see attachments 270147-270152 (there is no 270151). 

All records attached have been reviewed and observed to be in compliance. Annual Compliance Certification accepted.</td></tr>
