Overall, no issues of non-compliance were determined during the report review, however the following Areas of Concern were noted:


AREAS OF CONCERN

PC21.A.i: It appears that employee Shawn McCarty did not have qualifying Method 9 certification for the observations taken on 09-Apr-21 and 14-Apr 21. Per information from the prior semi-annual report, his certification expired on 02-Apr-21 (course taken on 02-Oct-20), and he was recertified on 15 Apr-21. However, per the requirements of PC 20.K.i, observations are only required to be taken once per quarter, which is not affected by the lapse of certification. For future reference, please ensure that the Method 9 observer is currently certified for all emissions readings.


PC21.A.xi Surface Emissions Monitoring: Quarterly landfill surface emissions monitoring completed from 17-May-21 to 19-May-21 (Q2) and from 02-Aug-21 to 06-Aug-21 (Q3). Results were below the 500ppm exceedance level, however all readings were greater than 490ppm. The readings are extremely close to exceeding, so please ensure that continued monitoring and maintenance are maintained to ensure emissions remain below 500ppm.

See attached document for full compliance inspection report.</td></tr>
