Dear Ms. Valenzuela:
Arizona State University (ASU) has compiled the semiannual report for the original Combined Cycle Stationary Gas Turbine required by Permit Conditions 31.a and 31.b. No excess emissions from the original Combined Cycle Stationary Gas Turbine system occurred during the period from January 1, 2021 through June 30, 2021. The turbine’s Data Acquisition and Handling System recorded downtime for the nitrogen oxide (NOx) and oxygen (O2) analyzers. The attached report contains a list detailing the time for each monitor that was off line resulting in an hour or more of lost data.

If you have questions, please call me at 480-965-1893 or email me at suzanne.kennedy@asu.edu.

Sincerely,
Suzanne Kennedy
