[pc 21.B.XI.] Notice of new Horizontal Collector installation on 20-Oct-2020 - COMPLIANT

[pc 21.B.XII.] No SSM Plan Report triggers occurred during reporting period. - COMPLIANT

[pc 21.E.] Facility reports no architectural coatings or volatile sealants used during reporting period. - COMPLIANT

On 05-May-2021; I emailed facility Compliance Contact, Doug Sawyer requesting explanation for reported data disparities to accompany report.
