[pc 22.c.]
• I verified the report was submitted by the 30th day following the six-month reporting period i.e. April 30th.

[pc 22.b] • Includes the certification of compliance status of the source for the reporting period 
                  aka COMPLIANCE CERTIFICATION REPORT
               • Includes the SEMIANNUAL MONITORING REPORT for which no [pc 16.c.ii.] deviations reported 
