                                       (0.05% of allowable)
   [p.c. 19.b - GT1-GT2] 2020 annual fuel usage 231,318 MMBtu [Limit: 2,928,000 MMBtu/yr] (0.08% of allowable)
   [p.c. 19.b - GT1-GT2] Jan-Mar 2021 fuel usage 29,589 MMBtu [Limit: 2,928,000 MMBtu/yr] (0.01% of allowable)
   [p.c. 20.f.i.; GT3-GT7] Combined rolling 12-mo startup and shutdown hours is 764.18 [Limit: 2490 hours]
                                       (31% of allowable)
   [p.c. 20.f.ii.; GT3-GT7] Combined 3-calendar year average net electric sales not calculable until turbine has
                                        operated for 3 calendar years. So far, only calendar years 2019 and 2020.
ii. Includes dates, method, and results of opacity readings; for which copies of logs in Appendix A prove no visible
    emissions were observed.
iii. Includes monthly VOC surface coating usage reports
iv.  1) Includes monthly and 12-mo rolling gasoline delivery totals; 
          Note: Highest Monthly Throughput for reporting period is ~1,957 gallons (&lt; 10,000 gal)
     2) Includes log demonstrating weekly fill pipe assembly inspections
v. Includes statement there were no deviations from approved DCP during the reporting period.
vi. Includes statement there was no cutback & emulsified asphalt applied during the reporting period.
vii. Includes dates, runtimes, and time emergency engines are run
      Note: Generac 125 HP LPG end of period meter logged 3.2 hours
      Note: EG1 blackstart engine end of period meter logged 3.7 hours
      Note: EG2 blackstart engine end of period meter logged 3.5 hours

[pc 22.c.] Includes Excess emissions and monitoring systems performance report (Subpart KKKK):
