<tr><td>CRPT001574</td><td>F002376</td><td>AIM Recycling Phoenix - McDowell Rd</td><td>Minor</td><td>Metal Recycling and Recovery</td><td>CMP022222</td><td>AIM Recycling Phoenix LLC</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Periodic Reporting</td><td>The Semi-Annual Compliance Demonstration and Explosion and Fire Report record for Jan to Jun 2020 was submitted for review.

The report was compared to the requirements of Permit Condition 4 as listed below:

4.a.  Permittee is required to perform a compliance demonstration twice a year, between 5 and 7 months from the last demonstration.   The last
       Compliance demonstration was performed 17-Dec-19.
       The Permittee as required obtained opacity readings of the emissions from the shredder and cyclone while processing material through the
       shredder, magnetic drum separator and Z-box for more than 1 hour during daylight hours. 
       Opacity readings on the shredder and cyclone emissions were conducted in accordance with EPA Reference Method 9 as modified by EPA
       Reference Method 203B by two individuals certified in EPA Reference Method 9 evaluation. The compliance demonstration was conducted
       under representative operating conditions.
 
4.b.  Testing commenced at 0721 on 14-Jul-20.  

4.c.  The Department was notified of the testing via email on 29-Jun-20.  Inspector Jennifer Valdez attended as a department representative.

4.d.  The report supplies all the individual readings and states that the water injection flow rate into the shredder was tested as required.

Submitted report demonstrates compliance with Permit Condition 4.

Permit Condition 6.b. requires submission of a semiannual fire and explosion report within 60 days of the end of the six month period.  The report was received on 29-Jul-20.  The report contains all the required information and demonstrates compliance with this Permit Condition.

Items used to determine compliance:
Records reviewed electronically</td><td>07/29/2020</td><td>08/10/2020</td><td>Yes</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Semiannual compliance report received on 29-Jul-20 via email</td></tr>
