Mr. Peshak provided the information during our phone call on 3 Aug 20.

I reviewed the semiannual report on 6 Aug 20.  The single HAP 12-month rolling total emissions is 1,865.9 lbs (xylene), and the and the total HAP 12-month rolling total emission is 2,857.5 lbs.  The single HAP 12-month rolling total emissions limits is 17,200 lbs and the total HAP 12-month rolling total emission limit is 39,000 lbs.</td></tr>
