Effluent concentration of VOCs observed to be 0.891 lbs per day. 

Methylene Chloride (MeCl) (a HAP) was detected in the effluent sample and concentrations have been observed to be increasing. However, the source remains under their 12 month limitation of HAPs. The source remains vigilant of increase of MeCl and will re-evaluate the SVE system operating strategy if necessary to remain in compliance. 

