•	Enclose the equipment and vent it to a baghouse.
However, Section 305 - AIR POLLUTION CONTROL EQUIPMENT AND APPROVED EMISSION CONTROL SYSTEM (ECS) allows the use of alternate controls as long as it meets the same applicable standards of the rule. To this end the department has approved the following alternative control:
