<tr><td>CRPT000956</td><td>F000010</td><td>Salt River Project - West Valley Service Center</td><td>Minor</td><td>Electrical Power Distribution</td><td>CMP015964</td><td>Salt River Project</td><td>Compliance Report</td><td>Self-Report</td><td>The Holder reports a communication breakdown after changing maintenance vendor for the 64 HP Clarke Fire Pump.  Rolling hours used for the months of June through September 2019 were not recorded.  The submission is attached.
