As required by 40 CFR Part 63 Subpart RRR – National Emission Standards for Hazardous Air Pollutants for Secondary Aluminum Production. 

One excess emission occurred during this reporting period. On 12/14/19 an excess emission occurred at 7:25 AM and lasted till 9:00 AM. The cause of the malfunction was a broken bag. The preventative actions taken include isolating the compartment and changing the bag. Percent total of source operating time during the excess emissions/parameter exceedances amounted to .02%. The rotary furnace 1 was the equipment effected. No other issues reported. There were no compliance issues observed inside the report. All required information provided.</td></tr>
